{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0661F0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"你以前一直都在研究核技术吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"不是。我原本想走航空航天工程这条路。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"对我来说，Sputnik Shock反而是一种好的冲击。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":58,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"我那时以为，科学被用于战争的时代已经结束，接下来将开辟一个美好的太空时代。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"我跳级进入<R=麻省理工学院,MIT>的那一年，加加林飞上了太空，我的期待也越来越高。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=麻省理工学院,MIT>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":113,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"虽然到了那时，我已经知道太空开发其实也是冷战的一面……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"美国被苏联抢占了优势，急得不得了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"是啊。不过对我来说，那是个好时代。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"我进入<R=美国国家航空航天局,NASA>，能够研究自己喜欢的东西。那是赌上国家威信的事业，预算也非常充足。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=美国国家航空航天局,NASA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":144,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"我知道只要给火箭装上核弹头，就会变成<R=洲际弹道导弹,ICBM>，但当时也没太放在心上。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=洲际弹道导弹,ICBM>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"不过那样的时代并没有持续多久。太空竞赛和核竞赛都需要巨额预算。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"美国靠登月战胜了苏联，但也就到此为止。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"接下来就是<R=紧张缓和,DETENTE>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=紧张缓和,DETENTE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"没错。结果NASA的预算被大幅削减。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":46,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"再加上父亲是核专家，我被调去了更明确的威慑力量……也就是导弹那边。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"在NASA时，我研究的是月面探测用的步行系统。毕竟月面也不适合用轮胎行驶。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":103,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"而Coldman正是看中了这一点。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":37,"review_flag":""}]}